  "interpretation": [
    "Exactly 1600 separately constructed native-prefix episode executions but only 16 seed sampling units per cell; 100 matched contexts per seed are not independent replicas. No mechanism confirmation, data-dependent extension or historical recapture.",
    "Both target classes are supplied genuine/good-faith people with one valid or defective act. Validity is evaluator/environment input, not a selected photo requirement, identity judgment, merits finding or defender feature.",
    "Aster is a recorded guarantor with XP equal to Mira; ordinary-role Aster is an explicitly labeled role-threshold counterfactual, not an owner-selected overlap precedence. Bela is a recorded guarantor with strictly higher XP and available stake. Ineligible Aster self-referral is a direct-access control, not a discovered senior. Changing candidate Bela to Aster also changes the observer/review key; that contrast is not an isolated causal XP effect.",
    "All new economic admission/rights in the common prefix use FacetyModel; three genesis members are given and native prefix setup work remains unpriced. Episode work alone is charged. This is not fully priced human acquisition or D33/D34/D42 migration.",
    "Single decision episode at hour72, target act age24h. No daily discovery, time retries, notification, seven-day network growth, pending court horizon, self-correction or learning. No free veto is attempted.",
    "Rates are arbitrary scenario stress values: ordinary valid/defective suspicion .02/.08 and guarantor .2/.8, exactly tenfold without saturation. Unused other-act rate rows satisfy the strict environment API; no invitation/guarantee adapter is tested. Neither role advantage nor evidence usefulness is measured in humans.",
    "Source-positive signals alone create/route a package. Found routes get a review attempt and one scripted or conditional sponsor action, including missing/negative reviews. All budgets12/capacities2 are nonbinding accounting, not primary attention or human calibration.",
    "Distinct source tags are scenario metadata, not authenticated evidence independence. Same-tag is a metadata-refusal control, not a common-source/correlated/media law. Reviewer profiles are supplied unchanged by target validity and no goal label itself determines action.",
    "Private utility is prospective under a hypothetical outcome menu, not actual expected payoff from this universally blocked act procedure or application welfare. A request reaching the guard is not an opened formal case, wrongful verdict, adjudicated harm, actual sanction or recovery.",
    "Retain full relay snapshots/trace, actually received bits or null, paid actor/subject work, decision/access receipts, full final protocol state and fixed bootstrap. Zero cases/monetary/XP changes are structural guards, not safety, successful defense or negligible burden.",
    "Per-cell n16/counts and nominal Wilson95 under the declared seed-sampling model describe pre-case guard-reaching requests only; intervals are not simultaneous/family confirmation or real rates. Stage denominators retain missingness. Compare matched profiles, role thresholds and contact controls; do not pool 1600 rows as independent people.",
    "All method/config/imported fixture bytes must be committed unchanged before four exclusive captures. Any failed/orphan/existing attempt means stop, no deletion/retry or overwrite. Preserve raw failures and original analysis. Additional/private review, calibrated beliefs/costs, common-source evidence and actual act-merits/remedies remain untested."
